  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Asia Connectivity and Trade MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the trust fund is to improve pro-poor
 connectivity infrastructure and policy reforms in targeted sectors of regional cooperation and sub-regions of PACT Countries (as defined below), with the longer-term goal to contribute to increasing levels of trade and investment, reducing cost of sustainable energy, and enhancing resilience through strengthened cooperative management of shared natural resources in PACT Countries.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
